                        <p class="mt-5 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-navy-800">UGC NET Paper-1 ke last 15 din bahut
                            critical hote hain. Ab syllabus complete karne ka time nahi hai — ab time hai revision,
                            mock, weak areas fix aur exam temperament build karne ka. Jo is phase ko samajhdaari se use
                            karta hai, uska score 2 digit mein jump karta hai.</p>
                        <p class="mt-5 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-navy-800">Is guide mein hum aapko ek clear 15-day
                            final strategy de rahe hain — kaunse din kya karna hai, kitne mocks dene hain, revision
                            kaise karni hai aur kya bhoolkar bhi nahi karna. Yeh wahi plan hai jisse GS Net Academy ke
                            kai students ne last 15 din mein apna score significantly improve kiya hai.</p>

